# thirdparty/: eigen, lietorch_5090, simple-knn, Sophus and glm are submodules
# (gitlinks + .gitmodules); diff-gaussian-rasterization is a patched fork with no
# upstream URL, so its source is vendored here. Do not ignore this tree -- a clone
# with an empty thirdparty/ cannot build.
